WEBVTT

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:15.110
Nothing can stop us now that we
 have the HeartCatch Mirage, huh?!

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:16.720
Marine!

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:17.870
That was close.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.210
Jeez.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:25.470
What other powers does the HeartCatch Mirage have?

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:30.920
It can warp you to the Great Heart Tree, or even let you see the Flowers of people's Hearts.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.280
Really?

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:37.660
It's thanks to Yuri that we managed to obtain it, right?

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:38.430
Yeah!

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.930
Yuri, thank you so much!

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:48.130
I didn't...

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.400
I didn't really do anything to help.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.960
You passed the trial with your strong bonds of friendship.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:00.410
Rather than fighting alone like I did.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:01.830
Yuri...

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:08.040
Grandma, can't we use the Mirage to turn Yuri back into a Precure?!

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:09.490
Well, that's...

00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:11.000
...not even remotely possible!

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.530
Yuri...

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:16.340
Use the Mirage.

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:19.220
Look at the Flower of my Heart!

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:34.320
Do you understand now?

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:37.660
I can no longer be a Precure!

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:48.870
Cologne...

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:51.700
I'm so sorry.

00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:57.990
<i>Moonlight.</i>

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:01.310
<i>Please don't cry, Moonlight.</i>

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:10.870
<i>I'll be able to see you again soon.</i>

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:13.960
{OP}

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:17.150
HeartCatch

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:18.610
Precure!

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:22.200
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:25.160
Now, all together

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:27.670
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:30.670
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:38.250
Within each of our chests,

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:40.920
they begin to sprout

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:42.600
The seeds of the heart

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:43.890
are growing

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:46.510
bit by bit

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:47.190
Red,

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:47.800
white

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.110
and yellow

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:51.810
It's because these blooming buds are

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.270
all varied colors

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:54.750
that they

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:56.940
shine so brightly!

00:02:57.770 --> 00:03:02.240
That smile that you've nurtured

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:04.740
with such care

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:07.460
will never wither

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:11.080
HeartCatch Precure!

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.950
Now, all together

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:16.430
HeartCatch Precure!

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:19.080
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:24.020
They're always right by our sides

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:24.850
So together

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:28.640
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:31.600
bloom even more!

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.100
HeartCatch

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.650
Precure!

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:46.990
Cure Moonlight

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:46.990
Cure Moonlight

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.000
Yuri became a Precure

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:56.280
shortly after her father went missing.

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:57.460
"Missing"?

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:02.020
He was a botanical scientist who was searching for the Great Heart Tree.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:04.550
His last known whereabouts were somewhere in France.

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:08.760
But then... {Can we lengthen this line a bit?}

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:13.740
After Yuri was chosen by the Great Heart Tree, her fairy Cologne was there to encourage her.

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:16.680
With his help, she overcame her sadness over her father's disappearance,

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:20.420
and fought the Desert Apostles as Cure Moonlight.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:24.920
Cologne was our mentor, and he was very kind!

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:25.870
That's right!

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:32.460
If Cologne... If Cologne hadn't died, then
 Moonlight wouldn't have lost to Dark Precure!

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:36.960
Moonlight!

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.380
It's Professor Sabark!

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:48.760
Moonlight!

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:52.230
Don't worry. I can handle them on my own!

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:09.270
Watch out!

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.110
C-Cologne!

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:26.350
Cologne!

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:38.280
Thank goodness you're safe.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:44.430
Goodbye, Moonlight.

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:50.310
N-No...

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:56.140
Cologne!

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:02.480
Cologne sacrificed himself to save Moonlight.

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:12.850
Erika?!

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.840
Where are you going?!

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:16.140
To find Yuri!

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:18.350
She needs cheering up!

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:21.560
I just feel so sorry for her!

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:23.150
Erika.

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:26.350
Let's go!

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:31.460
Yuri!

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:37.620
Wh-What's the matter?

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:38.620
Don't hold back!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.780
You can cry on my shoulder all you want!

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:42.080
Huh?!

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.120
Yuri.

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:47.880
We heard what happened to Cologne.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:51.890
All about your tragic past.

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:58.370
We just... We want to make the Flower of your Heart bloom again, Yuri!

00:06:58.370 --> 00:06:59.310
Like it used to!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.730
Please let us help give your heart strength again!

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.200
You three...

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:17.790
really don't give up, do you?

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.930
Tsubomi! Erika!

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:34.320
Itsuki!

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:35.470
Good morning!

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:36.690
Morning!

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:43.010
Truth be told, I couldn't resist designing an outfit for Yuri to wear at the school festival, so...

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:44.400
You did too?!

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:45.730
Wait, "too"?

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:49.940
Ta-da! We drew some too!

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.400
Whoa!

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:55.200
I want Yuri to wear something beautiful and get some energy back again!

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:58.210
Looks like we all felt the same way, huh?

00:07:58.210 --> 00:07:59.290
Yup!

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:02.660
All right then, show us your designs, Itsuki!

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:03.250
Sure!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:13.380
Lord Coupe seems kinda tired.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:17.100
Well, it must've been exhausting fighting them.

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:21.560
This light!

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:26.410
It is! It's just the same as when Potpourri was born!

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.360
Chypre, bring me the HeartCatch Mirage!

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:31.510
Okay!

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:38.860
You drew these for me?

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:39.370
Yes.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:42.200
We'd like you to wear them at our fashion show.

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:46.000
We want you to find a new you, Yuri!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.170
A new me?

00:08:48.530 --> 00:08:49.730
It'll change you!

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:54.590
Fashion has magic power that'll make your heart shine again!

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:59.890
And if your heart shines again, 
I know it'd make Cologne happy too!

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:05.320
You really think so?

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:06.500
Tsubomi!

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:07.750
Erika!

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:09.790
Ichuki!

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:11.530
Potpourri!

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:13.740
There, there.

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:18.440
Tsubomi, your grandma says you need to bring Yuri to see her as soon as possible!

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:19.060
What?

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:26.000
Speak, Dark Precure.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.420
Thank you, Professor Sabark.

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:31.500
Look.

00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:37.330
Cure Moonlight is...

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:38.560
No.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:42.630
Something very strange is happening to Tsukikage Yuri!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.290
Grandma!

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:08.190
Good work.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.080
Yuri, come here.

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:21.050
The HeartCatch Mirage enables you to see the Great Heart Tree, no matter where it might be.

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:36.690
Cologne!

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:37.740
Huh?!

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:40.700
I think it's thanks to the Heart Pot.

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:45.490
Because Tsubomi and the others collected so many Heart Seeds, a miracle has happened!

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:51.080
Yuri.

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:53.790
Go to the Great Heart Tree.

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:57.260
You'll only get one chance.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:01.260
Go and say the things you wanted to say to Cologne.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.330
Just press the blue button,

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:20.820
and the HeartCatch Mirage will 
take you to the Great Heart Tree.

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:23.150
To where Cologne is waiting for you.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.110
What is it?

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.340
It's Dark Precure!

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:43.840
Yuri!

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:46.890
Yuri, go and see Cologne!

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:49.220
Leave this to us!

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:50.060
That's right!

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:04.550
What?!

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:08.060
Let's go!

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:08.870
Right!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:20.510
Seeds of the Precure, go forth!

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:25.110
Precure!

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:26.760
Open My Heart!

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:16.470
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:21.520
Cure Blossom!

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:27.210
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:13:30.070 --> 00:13:31.610
Cure Marine!

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:37.300
A lone flower, bathing in the Sun's rays!

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:41.130
Cure Sunshine!

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:48.140
HeartCatch Precure!

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:52.220
Where is Tsukikage Yuri?

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:55.520
You're out of luck! She's not here anymore!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:57.350
Hmph. In that case...

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.440
I'll stick around until I beat the answer out of you!

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:34.260
Cologne.

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:36.350
Cologne?!

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:39.650
Cologne! You're there, aren't you?!

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:41.100
Cologne!

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:43.620
Moonlight.

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:45.930
Cologne!

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:47.150
Hi there.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.660
Cologne...

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:02.310
I'm sorry.

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:06.790
My body's long gone, I'm afraid.

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:14.510
It's because of all the Heart Seeds that Blossom and the others gathered that I'm here at all.

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:22.360
I'm sorry.

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:23.810
You died to save me.

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:42.820
I've always been watching over you, you know.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:44.750
Ever since we first met.

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:48.840
You always overdid it, trying to do everything yourself.

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:54.930
Moonlight!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.350
Don't you want us to find allies?!

00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:01.810
Cure Flower defeated Dune on her own, didn't she?

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:04.660
But things are different now!

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:07.690
We have Professor Sabark and Dark Precure to deal with!

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.290
I'll be fine.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:12.000
I have no intention of losing!

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:15.930
I was such a fool.

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.900
I thought I could do everything on my own.

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:21.620
I was so overconfident in my abilities!

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.590
Moonlight!

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:24.960
That's not true.

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:29.420
You risked your life to protect the Flowers in everyone's Hearts.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:33.510
You knew the burden of being a Precure better than anyone.

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:39.180
That's why you took it all upon
 yourself and decided to fight alone.

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:42.220
You didn't want anyone else to get hurt.

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:45.480
You thought you should suffer the pain on your own.

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:48.860
It was because you're kind.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.570
I know that better than anyone.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:54.160
Cologne...

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:01.170
You need to accept that, Moonlight.

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:06.070
You have to accept your kindness, and how you care for your friends.

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:15.130
Your new friends have taught you the importance of friendship, and to always be grateful for it, haven't they?

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:21.930
That's all you need if you want to fight the Desert Apostles again.

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:23.700
I can't!

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:24.890
Just look.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:29.750
That is but a reflection of your heart.

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:30.610
Huh?

00:17:31.140 --> 00:17:34.870
When you lost me, and were defeated by Dark Precure,

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:37.530
that's the shape your damaged heart took.

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:42.210
But if you truly wish to fight alongside them...

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:44.950
If you truly wish to protect this world,

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:47.710
then you can become Cure Moonlight again!

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.340
So make a wish to the Great Heart Tree.

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:58.930
That you wish to become a Precure again!

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:27.970
You really should just tell me where Tsukikage Yuri is.

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:35.090
Yuri has always been there to protect us!

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:36.720
Now it's our turn...

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:38.180
...to protect her!

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.440
Flowers, dance for me!

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:58.350
Precure Gold Forte Burst!

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:08.310
Gather, Dual Floral Power!

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:14.360
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:27.180
Precure Shining Fortissimo!

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:31.160
Precure Dark Power Fortissimo!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:40.110
Is this supposed to be the power of teamwork?!

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:54.000
If this goes on, they'll...

00:19:55.220 --> 00:19:57.120
Please, Great Heart Tree!

00:19:57.120 --> 00:20:00.880
Please make me a Precure again!

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:10.380
Tsukikage Yuri.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:11.230
Yes!

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:14.430
Hold aloft your Seed of the Precure.

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:18.930
Focus into it your desire to 
become a Precure once more.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:47.470
What is this?!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:50.830
Is this the Great Heart Tree's light?!

00:21:02.830 --> 00:21:04.160
You...

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:05.530
Have you...

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:13.270
Courage, love, friendship, kindness, sadness, and joy.

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:17.550
Within all our hearts lie countless emotions.

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:19.810
I shall fight!

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:22.800
And I shall protect everyone's hearts!

00:21:32.050 --> 00:21:32.940
Precure!

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:35.060
Open My Heart!

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:02.010
A lone flower, sparkling in the Moon's light!

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:06.660
Cure Moonlight!

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:18.060
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.230
Come on, all together now!

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:25.730
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.110 --> 00:22:32.660
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:38.250
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:47.220
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:53.930
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.800 --> 00:23:00.010
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:04.400
All those

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:09.040
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:14.280
Lose yourself is the melody!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:16.950
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:21.170
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:27.300
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:31.340
With all our might!

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:34.680
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:37.850
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:44.270
<i>Thank you, everyone.</i>

00:23:44.270 --> 00:23:45.690
<i>Thank you, Cologne.</i>

00:23:46.190 --> 00:23:48.780
<i>Thanks to you, my heart stands tall once more!</i>

00:23:49.920 --> 00:23:52.070
<i>I am Cure Moonlight!</i>

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:54.200
<i>O power of the silver moon,</i>

00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:56.450
<i>help me cast away my doubts and sadness,</i>

00:23:57.060 --> 00:24:00.930
<i>and grant me the strength to defeat Dark Precure!</i>

00:24:01.880 --> 00:24:03.500
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:06.420
What Incredible Power<i>!</i>

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:06.420
What Incredible Power<i>!</i>

00:24:06.700 --> 00:24:08.980
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
